      "content": "The audit report is a goldmine of \"near-misses\" that the IT lead will love to dissect, so I'll highlight those minor deviations as critical data points that prove the current system is already stretching its limits. By framing these technical nuances as \"latent risks\" that only the Advanced Continuous Monitoring package can detect in real-time, we turn their skepticism into a demand for better visibility. This approach gives them a concrete, data-backed reason to upgrade, positioning the new package not as an extra cost but as the essential tool needed to catch threats before they ever breach the 'pass' threshold.",
